        "text": "**Developing the Code**\n\nI've just finished the initial implementation of `consume_event.py`. I've used Google Cloud Pub/Sub via the `pubsub_v1` library and included the requested functionality. I've also implemented the use of environment variables for `project_id` and `subscription_id` to improve portability.\n\n\n**Refining the Implementation**\n\nI've just added error handling to `consume_event.py`, specifically around the subscription and message processing. This includes retries with exponential backoff for transient issues and robust logging. Also, I have incorporated some basic unit tests to make certain the core functionality behaves as expected.\n\n\n",
